  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/netstandard2.1 targets, native DATETIME, EXPLAIN with the executed operator, a sharded LSM block cache, typed reactive top-K and join views, ReadOnlyMemory<float> vectors ([VectorDimensions] models, parameters, SearchNearest), NULL keys held by LSM indexes (index-only GROUP BY counts), and ordinal text comparison on every path. Breaking: the paged Disk storage mode and pre-release on-disk format upgrades were removed; InMemory and Lsm remain.",
